{# One deliberate home for destructive record actions. Lists only navigate; the
   record page supplies context and keeps a misclick away from a fast scan.

   ⚠️ **`heading` and `label` are parameters since S133**, because "Supprimer" is
   no longer true everywhere this partial is used. A loan object is archived, not
   deleted — its loans used to go with it — and a zone that still says "Supprimer"
   over a button that archives is worse than either word alone: the operator who
   hesitates is hesitating over the wrong thing. The defaults are unchanged, so
   every other caller reads exactly as before. #}
<section class="admin-danger-zone">
    <h2>{{ heading|default('common.delete'|trans) }}</h2>
    <p>{{ description|default('adm.delete_record_notice'|trans) }}</p>
    {% include 'site/_admin_delete_form.html.twig' with {
        action: action,
        token: token,
        confirm: confirm|default('adm.confirm_delete_record'|trans),
        label: label|default('common.delete'|trans),
        action_value: action_value|default(''),
    } only %}
</section>
